{"title":"Best non-fiction books of 2025","link":"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/928782518/0/marginalrevolution~Best-nonfiction-books-of.html","date":1763790881000,"content":"<p>The year started off slow, but it ended up being a normally strong time for quality, readable non-fiction.  Here is my list, noting that the links lead either to my reviews or to Amazon.  These are roughly in the order I read them, not ranked ordinally.  Here goes:</p>\r\n<p>Caroline Burt and Richard Partington, <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/t/0/0/marginalrevolution/~https://www.amazon.com/Arise-England-Kings-Making-English/dp/0571311989/ref=sr_1_1?crid=U2NMU88CDRXW&amp;dib=eyJ2IjoiMSJ9.ZDTESFwe0yRuAny92bl6lcgqbbv31tli7YcjAQJ12Q7GjHj071QN20LucGBJIEps.miUmgaAmNG0BATjoA8WNVCA0wer0BA6pvaHaxQLKmpo&amp;dib_tag=se&amp;keywords=Arise%2C+England%3A+Six+Kings+and+the+Making+of+the+English+State&amp;qid=1736031821&amp;sprefix=arise%2C+england+six+kings+and+the+making+of+the+english+state%2Caps%2C75&amp;sr=8-1\" target=\"_blank\">Arise, England: Six Kings and the Making of the English State</a>.</p>\r\n<p>Tirthankar Roy and K. Ravi Raman, <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/t/0/0/marginalrevolution/~https://www.amazon.com/Kerala-1956-Present-Economic-Histories/dp/1009521659/ref=sr_1_1?crid=302HZDLC3CW1I&amp;dib=eyJ2IjoiMSJ9.83n-s5IL3fxSkDcoWGUXCdrYulJYwg-iXKcPDBD03ns_Q78M673XlK2FAlCV3Ww8YenjEjRaeZOQvGlLxCagvcInxLvQ4a-H--sHNYZraKVnJaBdp2HOXsP7NCagjYXXy5V9rmGhhEXum64ufYyy0A.AfS44i_qe6mTHCemitpFnC2eC20ZPf3HEj3erQmPR3Y&amp;dib_tag=se&amp;keywords=Kerala%3A+1956+to+the+Present&amp;qid=1736031647&amp;sprefix=kerala+1956+to+the+present%2Caps%2C71&amp;sr=8-1\" target=\"_blank\">Kerala: 1956 to the Present</a>.</p>\r\n<p>Agnes Callard, <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/t/0/0/marginalrevolution/~https://www.amazon.com/Open-Socrates-Case-Philosophical-Life/dp/1631498460/ref=sr_1_1?crid=1BVEW9BYLFE9I&amp;dib=eyJ2IjoiMSJ9.b5s6eyScm0q-MRCqffnBGkCPjg50FRzDXxKHRoIyBxO-FGGg9AJB1BcIiRF0-JT1STfE4jPgXqRcsp38r7kLAzm9JSfu6l8nX3Ws9itlpXw.G1MnWISzaRRZUvXYaKxEq3OAXLX1K1BXWt2S62iBFyM&amp;dib_tag=se&amp;keywords=agnes+callard+open+socrates&amp;qid=1763481897&amp;sprefix=agnes+callard%2Caps%2C280&amp;sr=8-1\" target=\"_blank\">Open Socrates: The Case for a Philosophical Life</a>.</p>\r\n<p>Amy Sall, <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/t/0/0/marginalrevolution/~https://marginalrevolution.com/marginalrevolution/2025/01/the-african-gaze-photography-cinema-and-power.html\" target=\"_blank\">The African Gaze: Photography, Cinema, and Power</a>.</p>\r\n<p>Michael Krielaars, <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/t/0/0/marginalrevolution/~https://www.amazon.co.uk/Sound-Utopia-Musicians-Time-Stalin/dp/1805330020/ref=sr_1_1?crid=1KYOHI76LM29D&amp;dib=eyJ2IjoiMSJ9.SJjvUnwTgBo-k7RYm5Qqpg.H9VXlpcVFeJRV9Uj3gDZbO64j3-z2rJRmetvXj_1ctw&amp;dib_tag=se&amp;keywords=The+Sound+of+Utopia%3A+Musicians+in+the+Time+of+Stalin&amp;qid=1738469674&amp;sprefix=the+sound+of+utopia+musicians+in+the+time+of+stalin%2Caps%2C140&amp;sr=8-1\" target=\"_blank\">The Sound of Utopia: Musicians in the Time of Stalin</a>.</p>\r\n<p>David Eltis, <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/t/0/0/marginalrevolution/~https://www.amazon.com/Atlantic-Cataclysm-Rethinking-Slave-Trades/dp/1009518976/ref=sr_1_1?crid=BGPMOD1SH10S&amp;dib=eyJ2IjoiMSJ9.nPM4h1Q3ps1SFMWoHnGGY_bzR9eaSRujemtjui0vQtY.ce3pzTwIwis5cHh2_oxWdW8iHvrF8Qe0iZF5IkwK3VA&amp;dib_tag=se&amp;keywords=david+eltis+atlantic+cataclysm&amp;qid=1738959783&amp;sprefix=david+eltis%2Caps%2C102&amp;sr=8-1\" target=\"_blank\">Rethinking the Atlantic Slave Trades</a>.</p>\r\n<p>Philip Freeman, <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/t/0/0/marginalrevolution/~https://www.amazon.com/Brewing-Luminous-Music-Cecil-Taylor/dp/3955932613/ref=sr_1_1?crid=1WLEHPUOJVOR0&amp;dib=eyJ2IjoiMSJ9.o3Gqi2eM5JRdYcA4oJkx_g.6d5T_WE3KPkKIAJ3Bm4ipd5Fd67KOU6DLCr2OCmCVbM&amp;dib_tag=se&amp;keywords=In+the+Brewing+Luminous%3A+The+Life+and+Music+of+Cecil+Taylor&amp;qid=1740612069&amp;sprefix=in+the+brewing+luminous+the+life+and+music+of+cecil+taylor%2Caps%2C103&amp;sr=8-1\" target=\"_blank\">In the Brewing Luminous: The Life and Music of Cecil Taylor</a>.</p>\r\n<p>Daniel Dain, <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/t/0/0/marginalrevolution/~https://www.amazon.com/History-Boston-Daniel-Dain/dp/1942155611/ref=sr_1_1?crid=2E4DFKHRV81MG&amp;dib=eyJ2IjoiMSJ9.OLyPZTNLxb8NmNuKMn93qEZqy7rT1YpJMpCWvojFA_Aw0IwbKYNtPwTyNiEQ6TOWtdgcolIMCNHVkN_jDVh4sZX8Xde6I1_hc4pFmGpO4ef0trlHISvWTN8hzFPk566AUsgRz0l4e5FK9XN1qDS6ztfY4sr7dnEiSsSdyxKVxEcB70OlCVt4rRFvZwDy44a2MfCm-EuIUswjcB97UOCOq-IW-fr3kOfuu93PD8NMNjw.xvxq2Oyrj3fjoM1DpIcNyfT7AoVliL9fE-s0ya9cCwM&amp;dib_tag=se&amp;keywords=A+History+of+Boston&amp;qid=1740931093&amp;sprefix=a+history+of+boston%2Caps%2C66&amp;sr=8-1\" target=\"_blank\">A History of Boston.</a> Short review <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/t/0/0/marginalrevolution/~https://marginalrevolution.com/marginalrevolution/2025/03/what-ive-been-reading-267.html\" target=\"_blank\">here</a>.</p>\r\n<p>Ezra Klein and Derek Thompson, <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/t/0/0/marginalrevolution/~https://marginalrevolution.com/marginalrevolution/2025/01/abundance-by-ezra-klein-and-derek-thompson.html\" target=\"_blank\">Abundance</a>.</p>\r\n<p>Ian Leslie, <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/t/0/0/marginalrevolution/~https://conversationswithtyler.com/episodes/ian-leslie/\" target=\"_blank\">John &amp; Paul: A Love Story in Songs</a>.</p>\r\n<p>Benjamin E. Park, <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/t/0/0/marginalrevolution/~https://www.amazon.com/American-Zion-New-History-Mormonism/dp/1631498657/ref=sr_1_1?crid=2MW5DQVOFE1PX&amp;dib=eyJ2IjoiMSJ9.a85ar1zbudAvRSgZN8gVb6_d8Kd1QEHtIm2ayoBpRH3nVNS_m0U_sTAbB5o9nVDNifYffxRMCasHPGiN4_wzs0bSV-XTc9iwbdBCZNM0NMzLhlXZ_ZLyG7mAJbyQAzrjRofVDjAOR5MVelR1vvfNUayWFDNRGKhf4k2G4J0MQbZec1dGoI4_OK5o-D784pdON4U3deEHnEK7ZK9xgYuwmFjZPkRaB_ZX3muHQVCDVG4.hK5fegvOmPDfM9t8xTDqMNd-KAQ_gsXYvZImsgfPrLQ&amp;dib_tag=se&amp;keywords=American+Zion%3A+A+New+History+of+Mormonism&amp;qid=1744506384&amp;sprefix=american+zion+a+new+history+of+mormonism%2Caps%2C83&amp;sr=8-1\" target=\"_blank\">American Zion: A New History of Mormonism</a></p>\r\n<p>Roger Chickering, <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/t/0/0/marginalrevolution/~https://marginalrevolution.com/marginalrevolution/2025/04/the-german-empire-1871-1918.html\" target=\"_blank\">The German Empire, 1871-1918</a>.</p>\r\n<p>Donald S. Lopez Jr., <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/t/0/0/marginalrevolution/~https://marginalrevolution.com/marginalrevolution/2025/05/has-buddhism-been-statist-for-a-long-time.html\" target=\"_blank\">Buddhism: A Journey Through History</a>.</p>\r\n<p>Dan Wang, <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/t/0/0/marginalrevolution/~https://www.amazon.com/Breakneck-Chinas-Quest-Engineer-Future/dp/1324106034/ref=sr_1_1?crid=1KNAZHITX5YNE&amp;dib=eyJ2IjoiMSJ9.FepqkKc0yS6paKaJ0CZg17W-DOvt4FfOah_rbbAchtU.1zZzdEHOKJqXxV_xai48uhmvnv8LOGMbsSeCo-fjSLA&amp;dib_tag=se&amp;keywords=dan+wang+breakneck+china%27s+quest+to+engineer+the+future&amp;nsdOptOutParam=true&amp;qid=1763488528&amp;sprefix=dan+wang%2Caps%2C332&amp;sr=8-1\" target=\"_blank\">Breakneck: China’s Quest to Engineer the Future</a>.</p>\r\n<p>Keach Hagey, <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/t/0/0/marginalrevolution/~https://www.amazon.com/Optimist-Altman-OpenAI-Invent-Future/dp/1324075961/ref=sr_1_1?crid=CR6C99T6LTNE&amp;dib=eyJ2IjoiMSJ9.ZoC5q2Jf6niiDOXc17gh0P7V33yc9k6JkUiuVqp9NFiV_b1ogADIJ6Uu23ZRZ8lM6XDaWge-pJQj-WV2PSK5wQ.AWGg9NnLMfivBjIAQZse6uWCLPuSLDS4dj53rPgwnnQ&amp;dib_tag=se&amp;keywords=keach+hagey+optimist&amp;qid=1763482099&amp;sprefix=keach+hagey%2Caps%2C286&amp;sr=8-1\" target=\"_blank\">The Optimist: Sam Altman, OpenAI, and the Race to Invent the Future</a>.</p>\r\n<p>Joseph Torigian, <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/t/0/0/marginalrevolution/~https://marginalrevolution.com/marginalrevolution/2025/06/the-partys-interests-come-first.html\" target=\"_blank\">The Party’s Interests Come First: The Life of Xi Zhongxun, Father of Xi Jinping</a>.</p>\r\n<p>Rupert Gavin, <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/t/0/0/marginalrevolution/~https://marginalrevolution.com/marginalrevolution/2025/06/what-ive-been-reading-272.html\" target=\"_blank\">Amorous or Loving?: The Highly Peculiar Tale of English and the English</a>.</p>\r\n<p>Sam Tanenhaus, <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/t/0/0/marginalrevolution/~https://marginalrevolution.com/marginalrevolution/2025/07/buckley-the-life-and-revolution-that-changed-america.html\" target=\"_blank\">Buckley: The Life and Revolution that Changed America</a>.</p>\r\n<p>Erik Penman, <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/t/0/0/marginalrevolution/~https://marginalrevolution.com/marginalrevolution/2025/08/what-ive-been-reading-274.html\" target=\"_blank\">Eric Satie Three Piece Suite</a>.</p>\r\n<p>Dwarkesh Patel, and others, <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/t/0/0/marginalrevolution/~https://www.amazon.com/Scaling-Era-Oral-History-2019-2025/dp/1953953557/ref=sr_1_1?crid=4NEN2YTN1EM1&amp;dib=eyJ2IjoiMSJ9.IeyxvmAKMgY1mXPt5jlSjm6YhjwiP4XN_Nwwh8oyOUXGjHj071QN20LucGBJIEps.yHVvmMhnWpdUrrwcjflCS56aViPeRNF8755r4YdhO7w&amp;dib_tag=se&amp;keywords=dwarkesh+patel+scaling+era&amp;qid=1763483605&amp;sprefix=dwarkesh+%2Caps%2C301&amp;sr=8-1\" target=\"_blank\">The Scaling Era: An Oral History of AI, 2019-2025</a>.</p>\r\n<p>Jeff McMahan, editor, <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/t/0/0/marginalrevolution/~https://marginalrevolution.com/marginalrevolution/2025/09/new-derek-parfit-volume.html\" target=\"_blank\">Derek Parfit: His Life and Thought</a>.</p>\r\n<p>Paul McCartney, <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/t/0/0/marginalrevolution/~https://marginalrevolution.com/marginalrevolution/2025/11/what-ive-been-reading-279.html\" target=\"_blank\">Wings: The Story of a Band on the Run</a>.</p>\r\n<p>William Easterly, <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/t/0/0/marginalrevolution/~https://marginalrevolution.com/marginalrevolution/2025/11/violent-saviors.html\" target=\"_blank\">Violent Saviors: The West’s Conquest of the Rest</a>.</p>\r\n<p>Nicholas Walton, <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/t/0/0/marginalrevolution/~https://www.amazon.com/Orange-Sky-Rising-Water-Netherlands-ebook/dp/B0FRG5KPL5/ref=sr_1_1?crid=HFCRB6PT9ISB&amp;dib=eyJ2IjoiMSJ9.GS8K0Xcv5IxwO66kI5YaLH5VvR5K_3EmHivmuxRCIDXNZZS9m5DFtLZ_t7YU6Z13riNX5wGfpIRkFaFY_k2FOR0lMJ5_hDlD-gep8lGhCRSXaMesgb4w-rY9nD_H1L3qWFoX7ioLo7v8ZN0oynWPozP9RP1lS8UelLCzqESwcVK9O5jndn7wVrE8SlF3u4u1iyZmlkofcwSjx8fIgMuT5_1O85X7UVnG16IH-Es8ZxM.hF28R65WhxL2zBESHH5uZzHd35ufSzOUugNvP3sprMc&amp;dib_tag=se&amp;keywords=nicholas+walton&amp;qid=1763482992&amp;sprefix=nicholas+walton%2Caps%2C485&amp;sr=8-1\" target=\"_blank\">Orange Sky, Rising Water: The Remarkable Past and Uncertain Future of the Netherlands</a>.</p>\r\n<p>What else?  I will give you an update on anything notable I encounter between now and the end of the year.  And here is <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/t/0/0/marginalrevolution/~https://marginalrevolution.com/marginalrevolution/2025/11/best-fiction-of-2025.html\" target=\"_blank\">my earlier post on the best fiction of the year</a>.</p>\r\n<p>The post <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/t/0/0/marginalrevolution/~https://marginalrevolution.com/marginalrevolution/2025/11/best-non-fiction-books-of-2025.html\">Best non-fiction books of 2025</a> appeared first on <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/t/0/0/marginalrevolution/~https://marginalrevolution.com\">Marginal REVOLUTION</a>.</p>\r\n<img height=\"1\" width=\"1\" src=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/i/928782518/0/marginalrevolution\" />\r\n<div><a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/_/28/928782518/marginalrevolution\"><img height=\"20\" src=\"https://assets.feedblitz.com/i/fblike20.png\" /></a> <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/_/29/928782518/marginalrevolution,\"><img height=\"20\" src=\"https://assets.feedblitz.com/i/pinterest20.png\" /></a> <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/_/24/928782518/marginalrevolution\"><img height=\"20\" src=\"https://assets.feedblitz.com/i/x.png\" /></a> <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/_/19/928782518/marginalrevolution\"><img height=\"20\" src=\"https://assets.feedblitz.com/i/email20.png\" /></a> <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/_/20/928782518/marginalrevolution\"><img height=\"20\" src=\"https://assets.feedblitz.com/i/rss20.png\" /></a> <a href=\"https://marginalrevolution.com/marginalrevolution/2025/11/best-non-fiction-books-of-2025.html#comments\"><img height=\"20\" src=\"https://assets.feedblitz.com/i/comments20.png\" /></a> <a href=\"https://marginalrevolution.com/marginalrevolution/2025/11/best-non-fiction-books-of-2025.html/feed\"><img height=\"20\" src=\"https://assets.feedblitz.com/i/commentsrss20.png\" /></a> \r\n<div><a href=\"https://marginalrevolution.com/marginalrevolution/2025/11/best-non-fiction-books-of-2025.html#comments\"><h3>Comments</h3></a><ul><li><a href=\"https://marginalrevolution.com/marginalrevolution/2025/11/best-non-fiction-books-of-2025.html#comment-160987581\">“The Technological Republic” by Karp?</a> <i>by Mort Main</i></li><li><a href=\"https://marginalrevolution.com/marginalrevolution/2025/11/best-non-fiction-books-of-2025.html#comment-160987565\">In reply to MikeP.   “Colonic titles” sounds like some ...</a> <i>by Michael Hoopes</i></li><li><a href=\"https://marginalrevolution.com/marginalrevolution/2025/11/best-non-fiction-books-of-2025.html#comment-160987350\">The land Trap by Mike Bird is also excellent.</a> <i>by Pete S</i></li><li><a href=\"https://marginalrevolution.com/marginalrevolution/2025/11/best-non-fiction-books-of-2025.html#comment-160987318\">In reply to Benjamin Cole.   Generic yet witty main title: My ...</a> <i>by Shorewalker</i></li><li><a href=\"https://marginalrevolution.com/marginalrevolution/2025/11/best-non-fiction-books-of-2025.html#comment-160987315\">Adam and Eve in Paradise from your be